<rml><head><title>Community operation</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml" /><link type="text/rcss" href="community.rcss" /></head><body template="prime-dialog"><div id="community_dialog" class="community_dialog">
<h1 id="community_form_title" /><div id="community_form_status" class="community_notice" /><div id="community_form_error" class="community_error" /><div id="community_form_transfer" class="community_notice" />
<div id="community_form_revisions"><h2>IMMUTABLE REVISION HISTORY</h2><div id="community_revision_detail" class="community_detail" /><div id="community_revision_count" class="community_notice" /><div id="community_revision_row_0" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_0" data-action="community:revision:0"><b id="community_revision_name_0" /><span id="community_revision_meta_0" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_1" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_1" data-action="community:revision:1"><b id="community_revision_name_1" /><span id="community_revision_meta_1" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_2" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_2" data-action="community:revision:2"><b id="community_revision_name_2" /><span id="community_revision_meta_2" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_3" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_3" data-action="community:revision:3"><b id="community_revision_name_3" /><span id="community_revision_meta_3" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_4" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_4" data-action="community:revision:4"><b id="community_revision_name_4" /><span id="community_revision_meta_4" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_5" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_5" data-action="community:revision:5"><b id="community_revision_name_5" /><span id="community_revision_meta_5" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_6" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_6" data-action="community:revision:6"><b id="community_revision_name_6" /><span id="community_revision_meta_6" /></button></div>
<div id="community_revision_row_7" class="community_row"><button id="community_revision_select_7" data-action="community:revision:7"><b id="community_revision_name_7" /><span id="community_revision_meta_7" /></button></div><div class="community_tabs"><button id="community_revision_previous" data-action="community:revision-page:previous">PREVIOUS</button><button id="community_revision_next" data-action="community:revision-page:next">NEXT</button></div><div id="community_creator_actions" class="community_creator"><button id="community_creator_0" data-action="community:creator:0" class="community_action">PROMOTE EXACT REVISION</button>
<button id="community_creator_1" data-action="community:creator:1" class="community_action">UNLIST EXACT REVISION</button>
<button id="community_creator_2" data-action="community:creator:2" class="community_action">MOVE REVISION TO DRAFT</button>
<button id="community_creator_3" data-action="community:creator:3" class="community_action">DELETE EXACT REVISION</button>
<button id="community_creator_4" data-action="community:creator:4" class="community_action">RESTORE EXACT REVISION</button></div></div>
<div id="community_form_report"><h2>REPORT FOR MODERATION</h2><p>Choose the reason and describe the issue. This report is sent only when you submit it.</p><div id="community_report_reason_label" class="community_notice" /><div class="community_tabs"><button id="community_report_reason_0" data-action="community:report-reason:0">BROKEN MAP</button>
<button id="community_report_reason_1" data-action="community:report-reason:1">OFFENSIVE CONTENT</button>
<button id="community_report_reason_2" data-action="community:report-reason:2">STOLEN CONTENT</button>
<button id="community_report_reason_3" data-action="community:report-reason:3">MALICIOUS PACKAGE</button>
<button id="community_report_reason_4" data-action="community:report-reason:4">MISLEADING METADATA</button>
<button id="community_report_reason_5" data-action="community:report-reason:5">OTHER</button></div><div class="community_field"><label for="community_report_details">Details (up to 4,000 characters)</label><input id="community_report_details" type="text" maxlength="4000" /></div><button id="community_report_submit" data-action="community:report" class="community_action primary">SUBMIT REPORT</button></div>
<div id="community_form_publish"><h2>PUBLISH SAVED PROJECT OR PACKAGE</h2><p>Enter the path to a saved map project or .ppmap package. Validation creates an immutable package. Review the prepared identity before uploading it.</p><div class="community_field"><label for="community_source_path">Saved project / package path</label><input id="community_source_path" type="text" maxlength="4096" /></div><button id="community_upload_validate" data-action="community:upload:0" class="community_action">VALIDATE AND PREPARE PACKAGE</button><div id="community_publish_source" class="community_detail" /><div id="community_visibility_label" class="community_notice" /><div class="community_tabs"><button id="community_visibility_0" data-action="community:visibility:0">PUBLISHED</button><button id="community_visibility_1" data-action="community:visibility:1">UNLISTED</button><button id="community_visibility_2" data-action="community:visibility:2">DRAFT</button></div><div class="community_field"><label for="community_release_notes">Release notes (up to 4,000 characters)</label><input id="community_release_notes" type="text" maxlength="4000" /></div><button id="community_upload_publish" data-action="community:upload:1" class="community_action primary">UPLOAD EXACT PACKAGE</button></div>
<div id="community_form_confirm"><h2>CONFIRM LIFECYCLE CHANGE</h2><div id="community_confirmation" class="community_detail" /><button id="community_confirm" data-action="community:confirm" class="community_action primary">CONFIRM</button></div>
<div id="community_form_conflict"><h2>REVISION CONFLICT</h2><div id="community_conflict_message" class="community_detail" /><button id="community_conflict_review" data-action="community:conflict:0" class="community_action">REVIEW LATEST AND DISCARD PENDING UPLOAD</button><button id="community_conflict_anyway" data-action="community:conflict:1" class="community_action">PUBLISH ANYWAY</button><button id="community_conflict_draft" data-action="community:conflict:2" class="community_action">UPLOAD AS DRAFT BRANCH</button><button id="community_conflict_revision" data-action="community:conflict:3" class="community_action">UPLOAD AS REVISION</button><button data-action="community:conflict:4" class="community_action">DISCARD PENDING UPLOAD</button></div>
<div id="community_form_import"><h2>IMPORT LOCAL PACKAGE</h2><p>The package and manifest are validated before installation. Installation is blocked while a loaded scene uses map assets.</p><div class="community_field"><label for="community_import_path">Local .ppmap package path</label><input id="community_import_path" type="text" maxlength="4096" /></div><button id="community_import_submit" data-action="community:import" class="community_action primary">VALIDATE AND INSTALL</button></div>
<button id="community_form_close" data-action="community:cancel" class="community_action">CANCEL / CLOSE</button>
</div></body></rml>
